# Voyager Ventures has NO required secrets for Phase 1.
# The static app ships pre-ingested datasets; ingestion scripts call keyless public APIs
# (PubChem PUG REST, JPL Horizons, JPL SSD, NASA NSSDC).
#
# Optional, for future adapters (server-side ingestion only — never exposed to the client bundle;
# do NOT prefix with VITE_):
# NASA_API_KEY=your-key-from-api.nasa.gov
